        <template v-if="page === 'courses'"><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><section v-for="course in courses" :key="course.title" class="rounded-2xl border border-outline bg-white p-6"><div :class="course.color" class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl"><component :is="course.icon" :size="23" /></div><h2 class="mt-5 text-lg font-extrabold">{{ course.title }}</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">{{ course.subtitle }}</p><div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-outline pt-4"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">{{ course.count }}</span><span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand">Cursos demostrativos</span></div></section></div><p class="mt-5 text-xs text-muted">Cada profesor puede enseñar varias materias. Los cursos pueden pertenecer a varios profesores y sus temas son opcionales para asesorías puntuales.</p></template>

        <template v-if="page === 'learning'"><div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3"><button v-for="(mod,index) in learningModules" :key="mod.title" :class="activeLearning === index ? 'border-violet-300 ring-2 ring-violet-100' : 'border-outline'" class="rounded-2xl border bg-white p-6 text-left" @click="activeLearning=index"><span :class="mod.color" class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-xl"><component :is="mod.icon" :size="23" /></span><h2 class="mt-5 font-extrabold">{{ mod.title }}</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">{{ mod.original }}</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">{{ mod.tagline }}</p><span class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-bold text-brand">Explorar <ArrowRight :size="15" /></span></button></div><section class="mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-outline bg-white p-6 md:p-8"><p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.12em] text-brand"><Sparkles :size="16" /> EXPERIENCIA EDUCATIVA</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold">{{ learningModules[activeLearning]?.title }}</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-slate-500">{{ learningModules[activeLearning]?.description }}</p><div class="mt-7 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div v-for="(step,i) in ['El profesor enseña','Registra la observación','Revisa las recomendaciones','El alumno practica']" :key="step" class="rounded-xl bg-violet-50 p-4"><span class="text-xl font-extrabold text-brand">0{{ i+1 }}</span><p class="mt-3 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">{{ step }}</p></div></div><p class="mt-6 flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-muted"><ShieldCheck :size="17" /> Módulo conceptual; no se han conectado modelos de IA ni almacenado observaciones personales.</p></section></template>

        <template v-if="page === 'integrations'"><section class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-violet-100 p-5 md:p-7"><span class="grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-white text-brand"><Cloud :size="25" /></span><div><h2 class="font-extrabold">Tus herramientas, en un solo lugar</h2><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-600">Conecta las aplicaciones que ya utilizas. La autenticación OAuth real está prevista para una siguiente fase.</p></div></section><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><section v-for="integration in integrations" :key="integration.name" class="flex min-h-55 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-outline bg-white p-6"><div :class="integration.tone" class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl text-lg font-extrabold">{{ integration.symbol }}</div><p class="mt-4 text-[11px] text-muted">{{ integration.type }}</p><h2 class="mt-1 text-base font-extrabold">{{ integration.name }}</h2><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">{{ integration.details }}</p><span class="mt-3 text-[11px] text-amber-700">No conectado</span><button class="mt-3 w-full rounded-xl border border-outline bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-slate-400" disabled>Próximamente</button></section></div></template>

        <template v-if="page === 'studio'"><div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2"><section class="rounded-2xl border border-outline bg-white p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold">Tu identidad, tu academia</h2><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted">Personaliza la vista previa sin afectar ninguna cuenta real.</p><label class="mt-7 block text-xs font-bold">Nombre de tu academia<input v-model="demoName" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border border-outline px-3 py-3 text-sm" maxlength="64" /></label><label class="mt-5 block text-xs font-bold">Color de marca<input v-model="demoColor" type="color" class="mt-2 block h-11 w-18 rounded-lg border border-outline p-1" /></label><div class="mt-5"><p class="text-xs font-bold">Tipo de espacio</p><div class="mt-2 flex gap-2"><button v-for="kind in (['SOLO','ACADEMY'] as const)" :key="kind" :class="workspaceMode === kind ? 'border-brand bg-violet-50 text-brand' : 'border-outline bg-white text-slate-500'" class="rounded-xl border px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold" @click="workspaceMode=kind">{{ kind === 'SOLO' ? 'Profesor independiente' : 'Academia' }}</button></div></div><button class="mt-7 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-brand px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white" @click="showSaved=true"><Check :size="16" /> Guardar vista previa</button><p v-if="showSaved" class="mt-3 text-xs text-emerald-700">Guardado en la sesión actual de esta demostración.</p></section><section class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-outline bg-white"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-outline bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3"><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-rose-300"></span><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-amber-300"></span><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-300"></span><span class="ml-auto mr-auto text-[11px] text-slate-400">tu-academia.academyos.app</span></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center px-7 py-11 text-center"><div class="grid size-14 place-items-center rounded-2xl text-white" :style="{ backgroundColor: demoColor }"><GraduationCap :size="26" /></div><p class="mt-6 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">BIENVENIDOS A</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold">{{ demoName || 'Tu academia' }}</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Una forma más cercana de aprender, con acompañamiento personalizado.</p><span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white" :style="{ backgroundColor: demoColor }">Explora mis clases <ArrowRight :size="15" /></span><div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-outline px-4 py-3 text-xs text-muted"><FolderOpen :size="18" /> Tus materias, tus cursos, tus alumnos.</div></div></section></div></template>

        <footer class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-t border-outline pt-5 text-[11px] text-muted"><span>AcademyOS · Your academy. Your way.</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1"><ShieldCheck :size="14" /> Datos ficticios, sin conexiones reales</span></footer>
      </main>
    </div>

    <div v-if="showModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-60 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-950/60 p-3" @click.self="showModal = false">
      <div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="dialog-title" class="flex max-h-[94vh] w-full max-w-xl flex-col rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-2xl"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-outline p-5"><div><p class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.12em] text-brand">GESTIÓN DE CLASES</p><h2 id="dialog-title" class="mt-1 text-lg font-extrabold">Programar nueva clase</h2></div><button aria-label="Cerrar" class="rounded-lg bg-slate-100 p-2" @click="showModal=false"><X :size="20" /></button></div><form class="grid gap-4 overflow-y-auto p-5" @submit.prevent="createClass"><label class="text-xs font-bold">Título<input v-model="form.title" placeholder="Ej. Introducción a álgebra" class="mt-2 block w-full rounded-xl border border-outline p-3 text-sm" /></label><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="text-xs font-bold">Materia<select v-model="form.subject" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border border-outline bg-white p-3 text-sm"><option v-for="s in subjects" :key="s">{{ s }}</option></select></label><label class="text-xs font-bold">Alumno o grupo<select v-model="form.student" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border border-outline bg-white p-3 text-sm"><option v-for="s in students" :key="s.name">{{ s.name }}</option><option>Grupo B1 · 5 alumnos</option></select></label></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><label class="text-xs font-bold">Fecha<input v-model="form.date" type="date" class="mt-2 block w-full min-w-0 rounded-xl border border-outline p-3 text-sm" /></label><label class="text-xs font-bold">Hora<input v-model="form.time" type="time" class="mt-2 block w-full min-w-0 rounded-xl border border-outline p-3 text-sm" /></label></div><div><p class="text-xs font-bold">Modalidad</p><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button v-for="mode in (['ONLINE','ONSITE','HYBRID'] as const)" :key="mode" type="button" :class="form.mode === mode ? 'border-brand bg-violet-50 text-brand' : 'border-outline text-slate-600'" class="rounded-xl border px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold" @click="form.mode=mode">{{ modeText(mode) }}</button></div></div><label v-if="form.mode !== 'ONSITE'" class="text-xs font-bold">Plataforma de reunión<select v-model="form.provider" class="mt-2 block w-full rounded-xl border border-outline bg-white p-3 text-sm"><option value="MEET">Google Meet (pendiente de conexión)</option><option value="ZOOM">Zoom (pendiente de conexión)</option><option value="CUSTOM">Enlace manual (pendiente)</option></select></label><label v-if="form.mode !== 'ONLINE'" class="text-xs font-bold">Ubicación<input v-model="form.location" placeholder="Sede, aula o dirección" class="mt-2 block w-full rounded-xl border border-outline p-3 text-sm" /></label><p v-if="formError" role="alert" class="rounded-lg bg-rose-50 p-3 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-700">{{ formError }}</p><p class="text-[11px] leading-5 text-muted">La clase se agregará solo a esta demostración en memoria. No se crean reuniones reales, no se envían invitaciones y no se guarda en una base de datos.</p><div class="flex justify-end gap-2 border-t border-outline pt-4"><button type="button" class="rounded-xl border border-outline px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold" @click="showModal=false">Cancelar</button><button type="submit" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-brand px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white">Agregar clase <ArrowRight :size="15" /></button></div></form></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</template>
